{
  "about": "Which way each doodad's front faces and where it stands against a wall, measured in the Editor (docs/reference/doodad-facings.md). front: the direction its face points into the room when it stands at rotation 0, in degrees counterclockwise from east, so at rotation r it faces r + front. placement: wall-foot (on the floor at the wall's foot), wall-face (hung on the wall's face), wall-top (on top of the wall) or free (anywhere on the floor). standOff and height override the placement's own. A doodad that isn't here hasn't been measured. Add to it with npm run facing-strip, don't guess.",
